        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>MAËLYS GET-DREAMY Overnight Toning Whip is designed as a nighttime body care treatment that focuses on improving the appearance of skin texture and tone. The formula combines botanical extracts such as milk thistle and uva-ursi with moisturizing ingredients to support smoother-looking skin when used consistently as part of an evening routine. Overnight application allows the product to work alongside the skin’s natural nighttime renewal cycle, helping maintain a softer and more balanced surface by morning. The whipped cream texture is intentionally lightweight, allowing it to spread easily across larger body areas like thighs, hips, and abdomen. This texture also helps the cream absorb quickly compared to heavier lotions, reducing the sticky or greasy finish that can occur with dense body treatments. As it melts into the skin, moisturizing ingredients such as glycerin and shea butter help reinforce hydration and maintain skin comfort throughout the night. The formula is positioned for individuals looking to address visible uneven skin texture, including areas where the appearance of cellulite may be more noticeable. With regular use, the cream supports smoother-feeling skin while maintaining moisture balance. Packaged in a 6.8 fl oz jar, it provides a practical size for consistent nightly application across targeted areas of the body.</p>",
